        "id": "scene_b2_u10_1",
        "desc": "A bright sunny picnic on the wide stepping stones close to the far bank: a round striped rug is spread on the biggest stone, and a small round green bug with black spots sits in the middle of it. Hedgie peers into his big brown mug and finds a second bug swimming in it, pulling a face; Bun points at the bug on the rug; Pip says the word backwards; Beads sunbathes on a lily pad. Hidden in the picture: the bug, the rug, the mug. Grumble does NOT appear.",
