      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u10_3",
        "desc": "The very last gap of water before the far bank: a blue cup with white stars floats in it. Beads threads c-u-p and the last stepping stone rises under the cup, completing the bridge of stones all the way across the pond; Pip shoots straight up into the air above the bridge with its wings wide, glowing, a trail of sparkles below it; Bun and Hedgie stand on the last stone shouting up at Pip; the pup and the cat wait on the bank. Hidden in the picture: the cup, Pip going up with a big upward swirl of sparkles. Grumble does NOT appear.",
