        "video": "vid_b2_u10_1"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u10_4",
        "desc": "Sunset on the far bank, the complete bridge of stepping stones stretching back across the pond behind the friends. A single big glowing golden music note has risen out of the pond water and floats into Pip, who stands on the last stone singing with its beak wide open and little golden notes streaming out. Grumble has crossed the whole bridge with his lantern shining like a small sun, and Bun has thrown her arms around him in a big hug while he blinks in surprise, nightcap crooked; Hedgie wears a pointy party hat; the pup runs in circles; Beads cheers. Hidden in the picture: the hug, the setting sun, the party hat, the running pup.",
